## Session start protocol

1. Invoke `/claude-code-discipline` — loads the 14 disciplines (manual recitation = discipline 11)
2. Run `bin/tool-census.sh --suggest "$INITIAL_TASK"` — surface 3 relevant underused tools
3. Decide: use a surfaced tool, or proceed manually (and justify)

