## The 14 disciplines (compact)

Full doc: `docs/CLAUDE_CODE_DISCIPLINE.md` (mirrors kit's `docs/DISCIPLINES.md`).

**Engineering (1-7):** plan-mode → iron-law (3-fix) → subagents → TDD-RED-first → verification → design panel → HTML evidence.

**Context (8-13):** < 40% utilization → R/P/I separation → KV-cache stability → recitation → errors-in-context → no few-shot drift.

**Discoverability (14):** tool census + utilization tracking.

