## Pre-push checklist (universal, discipline 5)

Before any push, verify:

1. ☐ `grep -rn '<func>('` for any modified function — all callers updated?
2. ☐ Any code-gen artifact regenerated (OpenAPI, gen-l10n, prisma generate, etc.) if schemas changed?
3. ☐ Full test suite green (not just the changed file)?
4. ☐ Lint suite green (`tools/checks/lint_status_audit.py` exits 0)?
5. ☐ For UI changes: design panel run with 4 reviewers (UX + a11y + adversarial + wiring)?
6. ☐ Evidence updated in `.planning/<phase-or-batch>/EVIDENCE.html`?

<!-- discipline:pre-push-checklist:end -->

